//
// The DeModFrame declaration for the Exsecutor presence agent.  This is the
// same @transitus declaration the certified codec (exsecutor/demodframe.exsc,
// spec §5.2's worked example) is built on, restated here so the agent's
// compile unit is self-contained: declaration, then codec, then presence,
// then driver.  The layout is the one invariant — 17 bytes, byte order in
// the type — and every field access below is the shift/mask/load the
// declaration states.

@transitus
publica structura DeModFrame {
    signum:  u8
    versio:  u4
    genus:   u4
    numerus: u16:maior
    fons:    u16:maior
    meta:    u16:maior
    onus:    u32:maior
    tempus:  u24:maior
    cursus:  u16:maior
}
